  "created": "2026-08-04T13:17:16.34Z",
  "description": "Stops Umbraco sites being OOM-killed in memory-limited containers while browsing the media section. This is the ImageSharp 2.x variant, for sites using Umbraco.Cms.Imaging.ImageSharp2; use Umbraco.Community.Imaging.ImageSharp for the default ImageSharp 3.x setup. Caps the unmanaged buffer pool ImageSharp retains and bounds how many images are processed concurrently, both derived from the memory available to the process.",
